#: dummy-hplip.cpp:12
msgid "Compression"
msgstr "Komprimeren"

#. +> trunk stable
#: dummy-hplip.cpp:13
msgid "Selects the scanner compression method for faster scans, possibly at the expense of image quality."
msgstr "Leggt de Komprimeermetood för't gauere Inlesen ut. Mag de Gööd vun't Bild daalsetten."

#. +> trunk stable
#: dummy-hplip.cpp:15
msgid "JPEG compression factor"
msgstr "JPEG-Komprimeerfaktor"

#. +> trunk stable
#: dummy-hplip.cpp:16
msgid "Sets the scanner JPEG compression factor. Larger numbers mean better compression, and smaller numbers mean better image quality."
msgstr "Leggt den JPEG-Komprimeerfaktor för den Inleser fast. Grötter Tallen bedüüdt höger Komprimeren, sieter Tallen höger Gööd."

#. +> trunk stable
#: dummy-hplip.cpp:19
msgid "Batch scan"
msgstr "Stapel-Inlesen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: dummy-hplip.cpp:20
msgid "Enables continuous scanning with automatic document feeder (ADF)."
msgstr "Maakt dat Slankweg-Inlesen mit en automaatsch Dokmenteningaav (ADI) an."

#. +> trunk stable
#: dummy-hplip.cpp:21
msgid "Duplex"
msgstr "Beedsiets"

#. +> trunk stable
#: dummy-hplip.cpp:22
msgid "Enables scanning on both sides of the page."
msgstr "Maakt dat Inlesen vun beed Blattsieden an."

#. +> trunk stable
#: dummy-hplip.cpp:23
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "Afmeten"

#. +> trunk stable
#: dummy-hplip.cpp:24
msgid "Length measurement"
msgstr "Längden"

#. +> trunk stable
#: dummy-hplip.cpp:25
msgid "Selects how the scanned image length is measured and reported, which is impossible to know in advance for scrollfed scans."
msgstr "Leggt fast, wodennig de Längde vun't inleeste Bild meten un angeven warrt, se lett sik bi Intreck-Inlesen vörweg nich fastslaan."

